OL,3,ASet time aside for children to read for
OL,4,Apleasure, schools to be told
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools in England will be expected to
OL,7,Fset aside regular time for students to
OL,8,Fread for pleasure under changes to the
OL,9,Fnational curriculum.
OL,11,FPrimary schools will have to allocate
OL,12,Ftime every day for children to read and
OL,13,Fsecondary students will be given time
OL,14,Fevery week to focus on entire books,
OL,15,Fpoems and literature, the Department
OL,16,Ffor Education (DfE) said.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
