OL,3,ASet time aside for children to read for
OL,4,Apleasure, schools to be told
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell is
OL,7,Fpoised to unveil the plans in
OL,8,FParliament on Monday, framing them as
OL,9,Fpart of a larger effort to address the
OL,10,F"ticking time bomb" of declining
OL,11,Fliteracy rates.
OL,13,FThe push to boost reading rates will
OL,14,Falso help with the "battle for
OL,15,Fattention with mindless scrolling", the
OL,16,FDfE said.
